msgid ""
"A finished work order pays everyone who worked it: quantity produced\n"
"               times the rate on that product's own operation in the bill of\n"
"               materials. Set the rates, then compute the period."
msgstr ""
"Yakunlangan ish buyurtmasi unda ishlagan har bir xodimga to'lanadi:\n"
"               ishlab chiqarilgan miqdor × shu mahsulotning spetsifikatsiyasidagi\n"
"               operatsiya stavkasi. Stavkalarni belgilang, so'ng davrni hisoblang."

